sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Alice as Client A (Editor)
    participant WSServer as WebSocket Gateway (Hocuspocus)
    participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub Cluster
    actor Bob as Client B (Editor)
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL Database

    Alice->>WSServer: WSS Connect with Ticket (JWT)
    WSServer->>WSServer: Verify Ticket & RBAC Permissions
    Alice->>WSServer: SyncStep 1 (Client State Vector)
    WSServer-->>Alice: SyncStep 2 (Missing Updates Delta)
    WSServer-->>Alice: Awareness Initial Peers

    Bob->>WSServer: Active in same board room
    Alice->>Alice: User draws shape (Local Y.Doc transact)
    Alice->>WSServer: Binary Update Frame (0x02)
    WSServer->>Redis: Publish update to channel "board:123"
    Redis->>WSServer: Fan-out update
    WSServer-->>Bob: Broadcast Binary Update Frame (0x02)
    Bob->>Bob: Apply delta to local Y.Doc & redraw canvas

    Alice->>WSServer: Cursor moved (Awareness Frame 0x03)
    WSServer-->>Bob: Broadcast ephemeral cursor (0x03)
    Bob->>Bob: Update Alice's live cursor dot

    Note over WSServer,Postgres: Debounced Snapshot Persistence (every 2s / 100 ops)
    WSServer->>Postgres: Write compressed Yjs snapshot to board_snapshots
